The following ports are used by the specified services:

80/443 - Nginx server
6000   - Open WebUI server
8000   - vLLM with Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct
8188   - ComfyUI image generation
9000   - Open Terminal
11434  - Ollama server

Not yet deployed:

8002   - Second vLLM server
10000  - Llama.cpp
18789  - OpenClaw

LlamaIndex typical ports
------------------------
  - Workflows (LlamaIndex Server):
      Workflows typically start on 80 or 8080 by default, depending on the implementation version
  - LlamaParse Server:
      Runs locally on port 5000
  - LlamaIndex MCP Server:
      Served on port 8000
  - Vector Stores:
      When connecting LlamaIndex to local vector databases, it uses their standard ports
      (e.g., Weaviate on 8080, Qdrant on 6333, or Vespa on 8080)
